{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42233","headline":"和张先辈见寄二首 一 · 徐铉","name":"和张先辈见寄二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去国离羣掷岁华，病容憔悴媿丹砂。\n谿连舍下衣长润，山带城边日易斜。\n几处垂钩依野岸，有时披褐到邻家。\n故人书札频相慰，谁道西京道路赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}